    <li>Some effects allow ships to move through such systems, such as the <i>Light/Wave Deflector</i> technology, the <i>In The Silence Of Space</i> action card and the <a href="/F_firmament">Firmament</a> player&rsquo;s agent, Myru Vos.<sup>2,6</sup>
